Project: Amazon Sales Analysis Dashboard | Power BI

Designed and developed an interactive Power BI dashboard to analyze Amazon sales data, track revenue, profit, and product performance trends.

Cleaned, transformed, and modeled large datasets using Power Query and DAX for accurate and efficient reporting.

Created KPIs, charts, and visualizations to identify top-selling products, high-performing regions, and seasonal sales patterns.

Implemented dynamic filters, slicers, and drill-down capabilities to allow stakeholders to explore data by category, region, and time period.

Delivered actionable insights to help business teams optimize inventory, boost sales, and make data-driven strategic decisions.
